      "cml:logicSummary": "Agency or Minister must not consider their own beliefs.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MustNot",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In deciding whether a practical refusal reason exists, an agency or Minister must not have regard to:  (b) the agency’s or Minister’s belief as to what the applicant’s reasons are for requesting access;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-amendment-reform-act-2010-sch-6-sec-24aa-ss-3-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Agency or Minister must not consider maximum amount payable.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MustNot",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) In deciding whether a practical refusal reason exists, an agency or Minister must not have regard to:  (c) any maximum amount, specified in the regulations, payable as a charge for processing a request of that kind."
    },
